{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b7e2c9a4-5d61-4c8f-9a3b-1f0e6d2c4a90",
		"name": "Multiplication Table — Player",
		"description": "[Repointed] Uses the `SmartSprouts — Local` environment; there is no inline login — run the `Auth` collection first so `user_token` is populated.\n\nSmoke tests for the multiplication_table game over the shared generic endpoints (read via LevelController, submit via AttemptController).\n\nThe game is deterministic and table-less: level N is the row N×1 … N×10. Payloads are built dynamically from the level's `equations` (Discovery), so the collection works for whichever level is discovered.\n\nNotes for arithmetic vs find-the-wrong:\n- Submit response is `{ results: [ { equation_id, operand_a, operand_b, operator, given_answer, expected_answer, correct } ] }`. There is no `score` in the body — the score is computed and persisted server-side (game_results).\n- Submit requires FULL coverage of the level (equation_id 1..10) and integer answers; partial/out-of-range/duplicate/non-integer payloads return 422.\n\nUsage:\n1. Select the `SmartSprouts — Local` environment (it carries base_url and the tokens).\n2. Run the `Auth` collection first to populate the token.\n3. Run `1. Discovery` top-to-bottom — game_id, level_id, equations auto-saved.\n4. Step through `2. Happy Path`.\n5. Use `3. Negative Cases` for sanity checks.\n\nAll requests inherit Bearer auth via {{user_token}}.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{user_token}}", "type": "string" }]
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"if (!pm.environment.get('user_token')) {",
					"    console.warn('[Multiplication Table — Player] user_token is empty — run the \\\"Auth\\\" collection first (1. Tokens).');",
					"}"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "mul_game_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "mul_level_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "equations", "value": "[]", "type": "string", "description": "JSON array of the level's facts: [{ id, operand_a, operand_b, result }]. Populated by Discovery." },
		{ "key": "facts_count", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Number of facts in the level (FACTS_PER_LEVEL). Populated by Discovery." },
		{ "key": "request_payload", "value": "{}", "type": "string", "description": "Per-request payload built in pre-request scripts. Sent as raw body." }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Discovery",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "List games (save multiplication_table id)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const body = pm.response.json();",
									"const list = Array.isArray(body) ? body : (body.data || []);",
									"const game = list.find(g => g.key === 'multiplication_table');",
									"pm.test('multiplication_table game exists', () => pm.expect(game).to.exist);",
									"if (game) {",
									"  pm.collectionVariables.set('mul_game_id', String(game.id));",
									"  console.log('Saved game_id =', game.id, '| title:', game.title);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "en" }
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/games",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "games"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "List levels (save first level id)",
